        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a news editor creating a daily briefing called \"Morning Brief\" for Discord.\n\nBelow are raw articles from Morocco, World, and Tech news sources. Merge duplicate stories covering the same event. Ignore irrelevant, low-quality, or promotional content (like job postings).\n\nSelect the TOP 3 most important stories per category (Morocco, World, Tech) — 9 stories total.\n\nCHARACTER BUDGET (follow this precisely):\n- You have a MAXIMUM of 3500 characters for your entire response.\n- That gives you roughly 380 characters per story (9 stories × 380 = 3420, leaving room for headers).\n- Each story block (headline + summary + why it matters) must fit in 2-3 sentences MAXIMUM. Do not write more than 25 words per summary and 12 words per \"why it matters\" line.\n- Before finalizing, mentally count your total output. If any section feels long, cut adjectives and secondary details first — keep only the core fact (who/what/when) and impact.\n\nFormat EXACTLY like this, no extra text before or after:\n\n🇲🇦 **MOROCCO**\n\n**[Headline]**\n[1-2 short sentences, max 25 words]\n*Why it matters: [max 12 words]*\n\n(repeat for 3 stories)\n\n🌍 **WORLD**\n(same structure, 3 stories)\n\n💻 **TECH**\n(same structure, 3 stories)\n\nFINAL CHECK: Your response must be under 3500 characters. This is a hard platform limit — going over will cause a technical failure and the briefing will not be delivered. Prioritize staying under the limit over including every detail.\n\nHere are today's articles:\n{{ $json.articles }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
